### DustShield Kathmandu — Full Project Audit & Development Report

Project tagline: Detect the source. Map the problem. Take action.

My recommendation is to build DustShield Kathmandu as one web application with three connected modules:

* DustGuard — monitor and assess dust-control practices at construction sites.

* DustMap — collect citizen reports and identify repeated dust hotspots.

* CleanRoad — help prioritise road cleaning and municipal inspections.

The central innovation is the Dust Priority Intelligence system: instead of merely displaying complaints, the application ranks locations that may need attention first.

This is a project-design audit and implementation plan, not an official environmental compliance audit.

