I recommend separating essential features from optional features. Do not attempt to build everything at once.

| Feature                    | Purpose                                | Priority    |
| -------------------------- | -------------------------------------- | ----------- |
| Admin dashboard            | Overall system overview                | Must have   |
| Citizen registration/login | Identify report submitters             | Must have   |
| Dust report submission     | Submit description, photo and location | Must have   |
| Hotspot map                | Display reported locations             | Must have   |
| Construction checklist     | Assess dust-control practices          | Must have   |
| Priority scoring           | Rank locations for attention           | Must have   |
| Inspection dashboard       | Review and update reports              | Must have   |
| Before/after photographs   | Document corrective action             | Must have   |
| Analytics and charts       | Show project performance               | Should have |
| Notification system        | Notify users about updates             | Later       |
| Live PM2.5/PM10 sensor     | Actual particulate measurement         | Optional    |
