My advice: do not purchase a sensor before the application works. You can demonstrate the entire reporting, mapping and prioritisation workflow using real field observations and clearly labelled sample data.

If you later add hardware, investigate an optical particulate sensor such as the PMS5003. It needs suitable power, integration and careful handling; low-cost sensor readings should not be presented as certified air-quality measurements.

